# a function declared in an aspect is used by its main
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#declarations-of-an-aspect
primary aspect b10_aspect_function is
  process main is
    apply scale(4);
    apply scale(5, factor: 3);
  return;
end b10_aspect_function;
